[resource]
script = ExtResource("1_q8eld")
release_version = "OFTF Extended"
notes = "[TITLE]Foremen Floors 4 + 5
New cheats:
Compensation
Seismic
Archaic Techbot:
Gains a phunny power move
Prethinker(Drop Immunity)
Uses a new big drop animation
Beneficiary
Can increase max hp maximum of 4 times in Penthouse 1
Damage Drift:
Positive base damage modifier 1.2x → 1.15x
[TITLE]Foremen Floors 7 + 8
New cheats:
Alphabetical
Allocator
Bookkeeper Fan
Cohesive
Confused
Laborious
Ohmmeter
Red tape
Relentless
Retributive
Sniper
Spongy
Suehappy
Supressive
Whistleblower fan
[TITLE]Penthouse
The penthouse now will appear in the elevator scene after completing floors 5 and 8
Penthouse 1:
Penthouse 1 level range [12,15] -> [13,15]
Completion will now send player to elevator scene going to floor 7
Penthouse 2:
A familiar face can be seen in Penthouse 2
New Penthouse Cutscene
[TITLE]Anomalies
2 new anomalies:
Unstable Core
Highly Unstable Core
Removed status report from Anomaly pool
[TITLE]Floor Bosses
Virtual cogs will be less likely to spawn with 2 of the same immunity 
Starting on floor 4 Foremen can spawn with the chartist
[TITLE]Items
Added Winter Hat (4 stars)
Added Faded tiara (4 stars)
Pilot Wings max damage bonus 16% -> 12%
Pilot Cap will no longer multiply base damage and will now increase the player damage stat by + 50%
Bee wings crit multiplier will now cap at +12%
Monocole will now display the first Proxy ability of proxies
Goon foot duration 8 seconds → 15 and boost amount 0.5 → 0.6
Sandwich charge count reverted back to 3
Gag button charge count 5 → 4
[TITLE]Rebalancing
Cog Level Ranges:
   Floor 4: [10, 12] → [11, 12]
   Floor 5: [12, 14] → [13, 15]
   Floor 7: [20,21]
   Floor 8: [21,22]
Gag goal rate reverted to vanilla goals
Toontask-specific cogs force spawn rate (45%) -> 25% (20% in vanilla)
Winning cog battles that start with 4 cogs before Floor in the mint & factory will no longer grant an extra chest
[TITLE]Elevator Scene
The cog golf course is guaranteed to have atleast one negative anomaly
Floor choices with 4 or 5 star rewards are more likely to have negative anomalies
Temporarily removed Decibel Disaster and Annoying foremen as preset floor choices
Survive the Foremen is now always the third option for floor 4 and 5
Survive the Foremen will now always have a 4 or 5 star accessory floor reward
[TITLE]Toontasks
Undid lowered quotas change for pre floor 4 toontasks
Adjusted toontask quotas
Survive the foreman floors will have a lower quota division
Added Yellow + Green Jellybeans into toontask quest pool
[TITLE]Tweaks
Added more toontips
Certain sound effects have a chance to play under certain conditions
Throw and squirt gags will now miss on cogs that are immune to them
Added a big drop miss cog animation"
